THE ARCHITECTURE:

1.src/BasicNFT.sol (The Blueprint): Writes the core rules—minting an NFT by taking a tokenURI, assigning the next sequential tokenId, and mapping tokenId => tokenURI.


2.script/DeployBasicNft.s.sol (The Deployment): Takes that blueprint and puts a live copy of the contract onto a blockchain (Anvil, Sepolia, or Mainnet).


3.test/BasicNftTest.t.sol (The Verification): Runs automated checks on a local simulated chain to verify that deploying, minting, and reading tokenURI all behave as expected without bugs.

4.script/Interactions.s.sol (The Remote Control): Doesn't deploy the contract—it interacts with (calls functions on) the already-deployed latest contract (like calling mintNft) on a local node, a live testnet like Sepolia, or Mainnet.

